WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
Medium Arch travels upward as the opponent jumps.

2
00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:01.990
The Arch anti-air connects and Dhalsim starts Drive Rush.

3
00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:02.580
Drive Rush back medium punch catches the opponent.

4
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.330
Heavy Yoga Blast extends the juggle.

5
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.730
Dhalsim activates Level 1 after Blast.

6
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:06.030
Level 1 completes the anti-air conversion.
